  "description": "<p>This task is to update the transaction API for committing a transaction to omit the '/commit' suffix on the end of the transaction-URI.<br/>\nThe rationale for this is to be aligned with the rest of the transaction API:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>refresh transaction: POST tx-URI</li>\n\t<li>rollback transaction: DELETE tx-URI</li>\n\t<li>status of transaction: GET tx-URI</li>\n</ul>\n",
